      <h1>Building an open-source AI media studio with App Composer</h1>
      <p class="deck">I wanted a place to make images, video and sound, and keep the work in an app I own. So I described it in App Composer and built Media Studio with an agent. Here’s what we made with it, how it came together and what it cost to try.</p>
