  </section>

  <section id="made" class="prose">
    <h2>Made in the studio shown here</h2>
    <p>We used the studio we built to produce the App Composer artwork and motion used on this page.</p>
    <p>For the launch artwork, I wanted a tactile paper studio with warm ink and an orange signal running through it. We made the first still with Workers AI, then painted a mask over the empty panel and asked FLUX.1 Fill to add the ring. The original, mask and edited image are all still in the project.</p>
    <p>Hailuo 2.3 brought the selected image to life, and Studio Effect supplied a sound bed. We added the type, mark, crops and vertical frame in a separate finishing step.</p>
    <figure class="figure">
      <img src={brandShare} width="1200" height="630" alt="Share card: a paper-cut studio desk with a film strip, waveform, camera and orange ring, titled Build your own media studio with the App Composer mark." loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption>The 1200×630 share card used by this article and the catalogue. The illustration is the selected masked edit; the title, rule, URL and mark were added during finishing.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <details class="production-details">
      <summary>See how this artwork was made</summary>
      <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <caption>Estimated request amounts and the real chain for this page, 2026/11/14 Australia/Melbourne (AEDT, UTC+11). Hashes are SHA-256 of the retained bytes; the studio holds the full records.</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Step</th><th scope="col">Route and setting</th><th scope="col">Retained result</th></tr></thead>
